es like mine do value your show  thank you for everything that you do  what a nice letter from Christy and  there are many people you know there are  many many people in our audience who  make a lot of money and they don't  necessarily  barely support the show financially and  that's fine there are many people who  because of their financial position  understand the importance of the issues  we're talking about and the issues were  activating around and that's why they  support us and I could not thank Christy  enough what a nice letter and I  encourage you join Christy the support  the work we're doing it is a tough time  for the show  we've got patreon even just $1 a month  through patreon means a lot at  patreon.com slash david pakman show  membership is available david pakman.com  slash membership there's a coupon code I  voted 17 whatever works for you whatever  amount works for you don't think that  because you can't contribute much it's  not worth contributing at all because  through many small contributions we've  built the program that we've built
 

